{"unit_id":"tag:001L:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，给定一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>，它位于<MATH_0002>中，我们得到一个相应的函子（functors）间的自然变换（natural transformation）<MATH_0003>，它通过与态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>复合（composing）而定义。这将<MATH_0005>中态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）变为函子（functors）的变换（transformations）的复合（composition）。换言之，我们得到一个函子（functor）\n<MATH_0006>\n注意，其靶（target）是一个“大”的范畴（category），见注记<REF_0001>。另一方面，<MATH_0007>是一个实际的数学对象（mathematical object）（即<SPACE_0001>一个集合（set）），比较注记<REF_0002>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"natural transformation","target_term":"自然变换"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composing","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"transformations","target_term":"变换"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"mathematical object","target_term":"数学对象"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"范畴中的态射。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"自然变换及其复合涉及的函子。"},{"source_term":"natural transformation","target_term":"自然变换","context":"由给定态射诱导的函子间自然变换。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"用于定义自然变换的态射。"},{"source_term":"composing","target_term":"复合","context":"与给定态射作复合来定义自然变换。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"原范畴中参与复合的态射。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"原范畴中态射的复合。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"变换所连接的函子。"},{"source_term":"transformations","target_term":"变换","context":"函子之间可作复合的变换。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"函子之间变换的复合。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"从原范畴到预层范畴的函子。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶","context":"所构造函子的靶是大范畴。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"函子的靶范畴。"},{"source_term":"mathematical object","target_term":"数学对象","context":"作为实际集合的函子。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"与大范畴相区别的实际集合。"}],"notes":[]}
